Fixes the default plugin painting an empty screen with muffin 6.8.0.

meta_compositor_sync_stack() lowers every window actor to the bottom of
window_group, below the plugin's background group that start() inserted
there, so the background ends up above all windows. Parent the group to
the bottom window group, which is kept below the windows.

--- a/src/compositor/plugins/default.c
+++ b/src/compositor/plugins/default.c
@@ -411,7 +411,7 @@ start (MetaPlugin *plugin)
   MetaMonitorManager *monitor_manager = meta_monitor_manager_get ();
 
   self->priv->background_group = clutter_actor_new ();
-  clutter_actor_insert_child_below (meta_get_window_group_for_display (display),
+  clutter_actor_insert_child_below (meta_get_bottom_window_group_for_display (display),
                                     self->priv->background_group, NULL);
 
   g_signal_connect (monitor_manager, "monitors-changed",
